        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 181,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  是......这样吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "是......这样吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 182,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  但如果真像长官说的那样，饥荒近在眼前，我们却还要......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "但如果真像长官说的那样，饥荒近在眼前，我们却还要......"
    },
    {
        "id": 183,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 184,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  ......只有快点找出犯人，才能平息这场动乱，放过这条线索，会很糟糕。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "......只有快点找出犯人，才能平息这场动乱，放过这条线索，会很糟糕。"
    },
    {
        "id": 185,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 186,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  我不是那个意思......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "我不是那个意思......"
    },
